# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Sample the checked circuit {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"
msgstr "3. Muestrea el circuito con comprobaciones {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before we sample, we transpile the checked circuit onto physical qubits (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) and into `ibm_boston`'s native basis gate set. To emulate a noisy QPU, we sample with a noisy Aer stabilizer backend whose error rates match the `noise_model` used to pick checks.\n"
msgstr "Antes de muestrear, transpilamos el circuito con comprobaciones sobre qubits físicos (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) y al conjunto de puertas base nativo de `ibm_boston`. Para emular una QPU ruidosa, muestreamos con un backend estabilizador ruidoso de Aer cuyas tasas de error coinciden con el `noise_model` usado para elegir las comprobaciones.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Postselect samples with no detected error {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"
msgstr "4. Posselecciona las muestras sin errores detectados {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`get_postselection_method` maps each shot to its syndrome vector; we keep only the shots with an all-zero syndrome &mdash; those in which no check detected an error. Discarding the flagged shots removes detected errors from the surviving distribution, improving its fidelity at the cost of a lower sampling rate. See the [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) for a quantitative fidelity comparison.\n"
msgstr "`get_postselection_method` asigna a cada shot su vector de síndrome; conservamos solo los shots con síndrome totalmente cero &mdash; aquellos en los que ninguna comprobación detectó un error. Descartar los shots marcados elimina los errores detectados de la distribución restante, lo que mejora su fidelidad a costa de una menor tasa de muestreo. Consulta el [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) para una comparación cuantitativa de la fidelidad.\n"
